BT /F1 19 Tf 64 728 Td (Robust Learning Systems under Distribution Shift) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 705 Td (A. Researcher, B. Scientist, and C. Engineer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 676 Td (Abstract) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 657 Td (We present an empirical study of robust inference in latent representation models.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 642 Td (The proposed regularization method constrains the model while preserving accuracy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 627 Td (An ablation analysis measures the contribution of every component.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 592 Td (1. Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 569 Td (Reliable systems must remain robust when observations differ from training data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 554 Td (This requirement is especially important in scientific and safety-critical settings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 539 Td (Our empirical evaluation covers uncertainty, calibration, and generalization.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 504 Td (2. Method) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 481 Td (We learn a latent space and constrain its geometry using a structured objective.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 466 Td (Regularization reduces variance without suppressing meaningful representations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 451 Td (Inference is performed with a lightweight approximation at test time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 416 Td (3. Results) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 393 Td (The robust model improves mean accuracy from 81.4 percent to 87.9 percent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 378 Td (Ablation results indicate that both constraints contribute to the final score.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 363 Td (These findings support the proposed approach across all evaluated datasets.) Tj ET
